  "description": "Born into privilege and raised like a princess, Oh Ro-Ji looks spoiled on the outside, but underneath the theatrics is someone painfully soft-hearted. To live a “normal” life, she’s spent years pretending to be the perfect girlfriend, forcing herself through a relationship that finally ends when her hopelessly bad-in-bed boyfriend pushes her past her limit. One night, Ro-Ji wanders into a women-only bar…and locks eyes with Lee Jin. Instant attraction. A spark she’s never felt before. And when Jin shows her what real desire feels like, Ro-Ji discovers a world of pleasure that she can only share with her.\n\n(Source: Lezhin US)",
